---
---

<section class="experience section-dark">
  <div class="shell experience-grid">
    <figure class="experience-image reveal">
      <img
        src="/assets/images/experience-santiago.jpg"
        alt="Women celebrating in front of Santiago Cathedral"
        width="2316"
        height="1308"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <figcaption>Arriving in Santiago</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="experience-copy reveal">
      <p class="kicker kicker-pink">The Higa Power experience</p>
      <h2>Walking inward,<br />together.</h2>
      <p>
        Our female-led, long-distance walks foster an inward journey. The Camino encourages women to tap into their inner strength, feel more confident and rediscover what they are capable of.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our coaching doesn’t end when the Camino finishes. We continue the dialogue so each woman can carry the journey’s positive change back into everyday life.
      </p>
      <div class="experience-stat">
        <strong>800+</strong>
        <span>kilometres of possibility on the Camino Francés</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .experience-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.12fr 0.88fr;
    gap: clamp(44px, 8vw, 110px);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .experience-image {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .experience-image::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 2;
    inset: -14px auto auto -14px;
    width: 90px;
    height: 90px;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--color-pink);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-pink);
  }

  .experience-image img {
    min-height: 550px;
    width: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 4px 80px 4px 4px;
  }

  .experience-image figcaption {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 18px;
    left: 18px;
    padding: 9px 13px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    background: rgba(24, 5, 31, 0.72);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    font-size: 12px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .experience-copy > p:not(.kicker) {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.66);
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .experience-stat {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 36px;
    padding-top: 30px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
  }

  .experience-stat strong {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    color: var(--color-pink);
    font-size: 48px;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  .experience-stat span {
    max-width: 220px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .experience-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .experience-image img {
      min-height: 430px;
      border-radius: 4px 54px 4px 4px;
    }
  }
</style>
